{"id":"paper-search-skill","i":0,"run":{"i":0,"reply":"我找了一圈——这个会话里**没有叫 `paper-search` 的技能**，`skill` 工具直接回「unknown」。所以没法按那个名字给你讲用法啦。\n\n不过登记在库里的、能干「查 arXiv 论文」这活的有几个近亲，挑重点给你看看：\n\n1. **`arxiv`**（github 来源，v1.0.0）—— 最对口：按关键词 / 作者 / 分类 / arXiv ID 搜论文。功能很纯，就是搜 arXiv。\n2. **`arxiv`**（clawhub 来源，2026.07.16）—— 同名但功能更全：搜、下载、总结，偏 AI/ML 研究者用。\n3. **`paper-lookup`**（github 来源）—— 一次搜 10 个文献库（PubMed / arXiv / OpenAlex / Crossref / Semantic Scholar 等），要跨库找、还要可复现出处时用它。\n\n现在这些都只是「搜到」，还没装、也没加载，所以暂时跑不了。\n\n你想怎么走？告诉我一个：\n- 回我**序号** + 装在哪个范围（当前用户 / 当前项目），我就帮你装；\n- 或者你先说想怎么查（比如「按关键词搜最近 7 天的 AI 论文」），我按这个需求帮你判断该用哪个。\n\n（要是你确定 `paper-search` 是别的地方的本地技能，也可以告诉我它在哪，我看看是不是没加载进来。）","tools":126,"toolNames":["astron_skillhub_check_availability","astron_skillhub_check_update","astron_skillhub_disable","astron_skillhub_enable","astron_skillhub_install","astron_skillhub_list_installed","astron_skillhub_operation","astron_skillhub_search","astron_skillhub_uninstall","astron_skillhub_upgrade","bili_comments","bili_config","bili_cover","bili_frames","bili_humanism_cancel","bili_humanism_candidates","bili_humanism_frames","bili_humanism_guide","bili_humanism_import","bili_humanism_inbox","bili_humanism_journal","bili_humanism_memory","bili_humanism_personality","bili_humanism_probe","bili_humanism_question","bili_humanism_read","bili_humanism_source","bili_humanism_status","bili_humanism_visual","bili_live_asr_probe","bili_live_audio_start","bili_live_audio_status","bili_live_audio_stop","bili_live_doctor","bili_live_feed","bili_live_info","bili_live_log","bili_live_request","bili_live_send","bili_live_transcript","bili_live_watch_start","bili_live_watch_status","bili_live_watch_stop","bili_live_watching","bili_login_poll","bili_login_start","bili_reply","bili_run","bili_search","bili_setup","bili_status","bili_subtitle","bili_whoami","desktop_control","desktop_sequence","drawio_render","drawio_template","drawio_validate","dsh_im_group_file","dsh_im_group_history","dsh_im_return_file","edit","edit_im